REPLICATION CONTROLLER
->pod is smallest obj in kops,crash koda avutai easy ga, so pods ki gurantee ivvalemu
->replication controller maintain desired no of pods(if needed it will create or del those)
->RC keeps an eye desired no of pods, if pod gets deleted automatically creates new pod
->mundu varaku pod>container now  RC>pod>container
pod ni create chesthey, pod container ni create chestadi
now rc will create pod, pod will create containers
pod with replicas
vim pod.yml
apiVersion: v1
kind: ReplicationController
metadata:
  name: myrc
spec: 
  replicas: 3
  selector:
    app: swiggy
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: swiggy
    spec:
      containers:
        - name: cont1
          image: shaikmustafa/dm
          ports:
            - containerPort:80
