REPLICA-SET
->same like rc but rc lo equality based selector nd in rs lo set-based sel
->set-based-sel lo multiple labels tho sel chesukovachu
->now a days rs ey use chestaru
->RS manifest file
vim pod.yml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: ReplicaSet
metadata:
  name: myrs
spec: 
  replicas: 3
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: swiggy
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: swiggy
    spec:
      containers:
        - name: cont1
          image: shaikmustafa/dm
          ports:
            - containerPort:80
->create rs
        kubectl create -f pod.yml
->chl rs created or not
